	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Wie ich dinen brieff versiglet, kumpt mir uß <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>diß zuͦschriben <foreign xml:lang="la">de verbo ad verbum</foreign>:</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>2. mensis februarii 3 Italorum cohortes a principe in <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><placeName ref="l631">Burgundia</placeName> sunt interceptae et ad internetionem caesae.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Rursum non procul <placeName ref="l3736">Neviduno ad Ligerim</placeName> <persName ref="p21324">Gonzaga</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p21323">ducis Mantuae</persName> frater, beneficio <persName ref="p7662">reginae nostrae</persName> potitus abhinc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>biennium et filia et bonis amplissimi ducis <placeName ref="l1860">Nivernensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>omnibus istorum Sodomitarum copiis praefectus a <persName ref="p8315">Conde<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>is</persName> quoque interceptus est et gravissime sauciatus, vulneratus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tamen elapsus est; sed aiunt vix mortem evasurum et <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>magnam editam istorum sceleratissimorum stragem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l301">Lugdun<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>o</placeName> per dispositos equos ad eum et ad alios saucios <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>missi sunt 3 chirurgi, quibus se <persName>Edmundus</persName> ille Iesuita <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>adiunxit, ut et animi et corporis medicos simul habeant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Blesorum quoque oppidum (Bläs) constat a principe expugnatum, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>id est a parte aliqua <placeName ref="l367">Aurelianensis</placeName> praesidii.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Fama <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quoque idem affert de <placeName ref="l1497">Turonibus</placeName> (Thierß) et iam obsideri <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l59">Biturigas</placeName> (<placeName ref="l59">Burges</placeName>) principe interim <placeName ref="l378">Lu<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>tetiam</placeName> petente.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed haec non ita certa ut superiora.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName>Adazeres</persName> apostata cum tertium oppugnasset <placeName>Costam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>oppidum ad <placeName ref="l3048">Rhodanum</placeName>, quod obtinebant 400 Condenses, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sub noctem egressi salvi cum omnibus incolis evasere.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Mane ille vacuam ingressus urbem inhorruit; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nam milites eius seditione excitata arbit<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>rati sunt duce <placeName>Adazeres</placeName> conscio istos evasisse, et <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>dilapsae sunt copiae omnes.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Audisti procul dubio de <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>immensa <placeName ref="l2510">Turcarum</placeName> classe, qua cogitet <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>invadere.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName> accidit quiddam in<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>credibile, sed tamen certissimum <persName>Carolum</persName>, Philippi filium, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>cogitare de nece patris Philippi et ideo <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ipsum nunc custodiri; causa nescitur, omnes tamen clamant <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>magnum esse infortunium.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Haec verbotim<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">wörtlich; vgl. <bibl source="b316">Hoven</bibl> 378.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> ad me missa sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l167">Geneva</placeName> scribit 24. februarii: Certum est virum, qui tuas <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>et meas accepit literas ad filium tuum <persName>Christo<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>phorum</persName> in castra principis salvum pervenisse; nil tamen <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>responsi accipimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed ne illustrissimus quidem prin<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ceps <persName>Palatinus</persName>, qui hic est, a fratre <persName>Casimiro</persName> ullas <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>adhuc accepit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Mox mittam, si quid accepero etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Ohne Datum, Unterschrift und Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
